          <span style="display:inline-block;background:#1e3a5f;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:4px;letter-spacing:0.02em;">RI HB 1602</span>
          <span style="color:#0f172a;font-size:12px;font-family:'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif;margin-left:8px;">Automatic voter registration at the DMV</span>
