      <td align="right" style="padding:11px 14px 0 0;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;"><span style="font-size:12px;color:#667386;">June 10, 2026 at 4:45 PM</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr style="background:#fff;"><td colspan="3" style="padding:4px 14px 14px 34px;font-size:14px;color:#374151;line-height:1.5;"><p style="margin:0 0 12px;line-height:1.6;color:#334155;">Hey <span style="background:#f1f5f9;color:#475569;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:4px;font-weight:500;">@Dana Reed</span> — we should testify against this at Thursday's hearing. Can you pull the talking points?</p></td></tr>
