            <div style="margin-top:18px;"><a href="https://sample.test/RI/2026/HB 1234#comment-sample-comment" style="display:inline-block;background:#3b82f6;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:6px;">View comment</a></div>
